From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:51:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] MiuiCamera: Use the stock mod_device

The app reads ro.product.mod_device to tell global builds from Chinese
ones and asks for MIUI's Security Center on the latter. Use the stock
value directly instead of setting the property system-wide.
